Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://git.ti.com/cgit/edgeai/edgeai-apps-utils

Package: edgeai-apps-utils
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 libc6,
 libstdc++6,
 libtivision-apps11.2.0
Description: TI EdgeAI Apps Utils library
 ARMv8 NEON-optimised pre/post-processing utility functions for TI EdgeAI
 pipelines.  Implements colour conversion, DL pre-processing, scaling, NV12
 drawing, and performance-stats overlays.
 .
 Provides libedgeai-apps-utils.so.0 and installs the source tree under
 /opt/edgeai-apps-utils/ for on-target development.
 .
 Compatible with: j721e, j721s2, j784s4, j722s, j742s2, am62axx.

Package: edgeai-apps-utils-dev
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, edgeai-apps-utils (= ${binary:Version})
Description: TI EdgeAI Apps Utils library - development files
 Headers and unversioned .so symlink for building against the
 EdgeAI Apps Utils library.
 .
 Headers are installed under /usr/include/edgeai-apps-utils/.
